# Frontend Package (Week 6 Draft)

React application for the Adaptive Bilingual Learning Platform frontend.

## Dependencies

### Core
- `react` `react-dom` - UI library
- `react-router-dom` - Client-side routing
- `axios` - API client for backend calls

### State & Side Effects
- `zustand` - Lightweight state management (alternative to Redux)
- `sweetalert2` - Beautiful modals for user confirmations

### i18n & Bilingual Support
- `react-i18next` - Internationalization
- `i18next` - Core i18n engine
- `i18next-browser-languagedetector` - Browser language detection

### ARIA & Accessibility
- `@testing-library/react` - Testing utilities
- `@testing-library/user-event` - User interaction testing

### Development
- `vite` - Build tool and dev server
- `eslint` - Linting
- `prettier` - Code formatting

## Scripts

